# Raw input: Create a photorealistic scene of Venice at golden hour, featuring a gondola gliding through the Grand Canal. The gondolier, dressed in a crisp white shirt, dark trousers, and a straw boater with a red ribbon, steers the wooden gondola (with visible grain and slight wear) through the water.  

The environment includes historic Venetian buildings lining the canal—stone facades with weathered textures, arched windows, and balconies adorned with potted plants. In the background, the Rialto Bridge’s stone arches frame the scene, with soft light illuminating its intricate carvings.  

The mood is serene and romantic, capturing the timeless allure of Venice. Lighting is warm golden-hour light casting soft shadows on building facades, with long rays reflecting off the canal’s rippled water surface.  

Colors are rich and harmonious: deep golden hues from the sunset, contrasted with cool deep blues of the canal water. Building facades feature earthy tones—beiges, grays, muted reds from aged bricks. The gondola’s wooden hull is warm honey-colored wood with visible grain and slight wear.  

Textures are intricate: smooth reflective water surface with gentle ripples from the gondola’s movement; stone building facades with rough weathered textures, visible cracks, and patches of moss/lichen on balconies; gondola’s wooden hull with rich tactile texture, visible wood grain, and slight wear from use.  

Artistic style is realistic yet painterly, capturing Venice’s essence through detailed textures and warm lighting. The style evokes classic European landscape paintings, focusing on light-shadow play on historic architecture. Composition is balanced, with gondola as central focal point leading viewer’s eye through winding canals.  

Quality tags: High-resolution, ultra-detailed photorealistic rendering; cinematic lighting with warm golden-hour tones; rich harmonious color palette blending deep golds, cool blues, and earthy building hues; intricate textural details including reflective water surface with ripples, weathered stone building facades with cracks and moss patches, and richly grained wooden gondola hull; realistic water reflections capturing light and surrounding architecture; atmospheric perspective enhancing depth of field with distant Rialto Bridge softly blurred yet recognizable.
